BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:🎉 PARK YOUTH FALL KICKOFF! 🏈
DTSTART:20260826T230000Z
DTEND:20260827T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260821T085327Z
UID:bfchamber-%f0%9f%8e%89-park-youth-fall-kickoff-%f0%9f%8f%88-2026-08-26
 -0600@linn-county-scraper.local
DESCRIPTION:You’re invited! 🎉Park Youth is kicking off a brand-new sc
 hool year\, and we want to invite students from all across our community t
 o join us!Our Fall Kickoff is Wednesday\, August 26\, from 6:00–7:30 p.m
 . in the Park Baptist Church parking lot. This is the first Park Youth eve
 nt of the school year\, and it’s the perfect night for students grades 5
 -12 to come check us out\, meet new friends\, and see what Park Youth is a
 ll about! 🙌 You do NOT have to attend Park Baptist Church to be part of
  Park Youth!Our desire is to come alongside students wherever they are in 
 their faith journey. We have amazing adult mentors and small group leaders
  who are passionate about helping students learn what it means to follow J
 esus\, grow in their faith\, build godly friendships\, and navigate life w
 ith Christ at the center. ❤️🏈 FALL KICKOFF🍔 Food🏈 Football + 
 games👥 Meet new friends & small group leaders🙌 Learn more about Park
  Youth👕 Tailgate theme: Wear your favorite team gear!Parents are welcom
 e\, too! Come meet our leaders\, learn more about Park Youth\, and see how
  we can partner with you as your student grows in their walk with Jesus. 
 ❤️📅 REGULAR WEDNESDAY NIGHTS BEGIN SEPTEMBER 2Middle School: 5:30
 –7:30 p.m.High School: 6:30–8:30 p.m.Awana: 5:30–7:30 p.m.🚐 Van t
 ransportation is available starting Sept. 2 when you register online.🔗 
 READY TO JOIN US? Register Here!Youth (Grades 5–12):https://www.parkbapt
 ist.com/youthAwana (4 years–4th grade):https://www.parkbaptist.com/Bring
  a friend. Come check us out. Find a place to belong. 🙌We can’t wait 
 to kick off the school year with you! ❤️🏈Please reach out to Avery 
 Bailey at Park Baptist Church with any questions. avery@parkbaptist.com
LOCATION:Park Baptist Church | Brookfield\, MO
END:VEVENT
